<%# The ticket list's Proof mark, in two stages of one thing. Blank while the ticket does not say
    what would prove it is fixed. An outlined grey check once the customer wrote or chose what
    would. The solid green check once the customer confirmed the fix. The two are the same size,
    and only the second is filled, so they differ in more than colour. Each is drawn by the style
    sheet, so the page carries no picture markup. %>
<% if (ticket.resolution && ticket.resolution.by === "customer") { %>
<span class="proof-mark confirmed-mark" role="img" aria-label="Customer confirmed" title="Customer confirmed"></span>
<% } else if (ticket.fix_check) { %>
<span class="proof-mark proof-said" role="img" aria-label="Says what would prove it" title="Says what would prove it"></span>
<% } %>
